=======================

	Key [ field-name     = token] Field names are case-insensitive and ought to be registered within the "Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP) Field Name Registry";
	
	Value [ field-value    = *field-content
  				field-content  = field-vchar [ 1*( SP / HTAB / field-vchar ) field-vchar ]
  						field-vchar    = VCHAR / obs-text (i.e. %x21-7E or 33 - 126)
 							obs-text       = %x80-FF (i.e. 128-255)]
			[In simple terms a value can contain  33 <= c <= 126 && 128 <= c <= 255 and are space separated]

